WEBVTT

1
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:14,410
What's wrong

2
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:21,410
I thought it was some big deal

3
00:00:21,410 --> 00:00:23,650
Auntie is here and she is yelling.

4
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:25,450
Is it strange that my aunt is here?

5
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:27,650
If you don't come, then you're in a hurry.

6
00:00:27,650 --> 00:00:29,090
I don’t have Aunt Jin anymore

7
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:30,730
I haven’t bought it this time in advance.

8
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:32,340
Did you bring it?

9
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:33,580
I'm still early

10
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:36,720
Why should I carry that thing with me?

11
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:38,000
I'll go out and buy it for you

12
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,080
It's really annoying. You're up late at night.

13
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:41,160
I still have to change clothes

14
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:42,400
If you can afford it, drive out

15
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:43,840
The nearby stores have already closed

16
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:45,910
You can't drive

17
00:00:45,910 --> 00:00:47,510
What should we do?

18
00:00:47,510 --> 00:00:49,710
Can't you ask Chen Yundong to go out and buy it for you?

19
00:00:49,790 --> 00:00:51,540
Can't let him know

20
00:00:51,540 --> 00:00:53,580
How will I face him in the future?

21
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:55,180
Then you just wait while I go find him

22
00:00:55,180 --> 00:01:02,830
Leave it alone

23
00:01:02,830 --> 00:01:10,950
are you okay

24
00:01:10,950 --> 00:01:13,750
If nothing happens, I can’t come to you.

25
00:01:13,750 --> 00:01:15,470
You said this happened in the middle of the night?

26
00:01:15,470 --> 00:01:18,020
I came to your room as a woman

27
00:01:18,020 --> 00:01:20,140
Still sitting on your bed

28
00:01:20,140 --> 00:01:23,940
What did you say I came to see you for?

29
00:01:23,940 --> 00:01:24,940
Stop kidding
